Business example: A trainee analyst receives an unfamiliar retail database and must first learn its structure without modifying transactions. Worked solution or syntax:
SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type = 'table';
SELECT * FROM orders LIMIT 5;

Business example: An analytics lead reviews the correctness and maintainability of a monthly revenue extract before distribution. Worked solution or syntax:
SELECT COUNT(*) AS rows,
ROUND(SUM(quantity*unit_price*(1-discount_pct)),2) AS net_revenue
FROM orders WHERE status='Completed';
EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN SELECT * FROM orders WHERE order_id='O0001';
